{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-9","kind":"proposition","title":"圆内从一点至界作三线以上皆等即此点必圆心","englishTitle":"If a point be taken within a circle, and more than two equal straight lines fall from the point on the circle, the point taken is the centre of the circle.","book":3,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","contentId":"euclid-3-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aac4531bfff1b76b5b9ec12bef419e711f26491221dc72ca012657465272847d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-9.statement","euclid-3-9.construction.1","euclid-3-9.construction.2","euclid-3-9.proof.1","euclid-3-9.proof.2","euclid-3-9.proof.3","euclid-3-9.proof.4","euclid-3-9.proof.5","euclid-3-9.conclusion","euclid-3-9.historical.1","euclid-3-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcf324ee60dd2655ac2ffdcd6902b94fff6cfc93ee9865224215295e20d2fb30","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a point be taken within a circle, and more than two equal straight lines fall from the point on the circle, the point taken is the centre of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在圆内取一个点,而圆上点的两条相等直线,则取的点是圆的中心。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜内从一点至界作三线以上皆等即此点必圜心"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个圆内，从一点到边界，三条或更多的线都相等；也就是说，这一点必须是圆心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f899dbe11f438ef58d7a587a2a9892816da05f349aad7e103957312cb996a2a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a circle and D a point within it, and from D let more than two equal straight lines, namely DA, DB, DC, fall on the circle ABC; I say that the point D is the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC圆圈,让D点内,从D线条中,让两个相等的直线,即DA、DB、DC,横交ABC圆圈内;我说,D点是ABC圆圈的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"813a3d387cc34392e7addc2a8b2e67d71457fb152576b91e987772e31b23a752","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AB, BC be joined and bisected at the points E, F, and let ED, FD be joined and drawn through to the points G, K, H, L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC在E,F点连接和两部分分割,ED,FD连接和通过G,K,H,L点连接和提取。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe7eea0edf6e98f143b2f10415bd20fbb9c60138bb0861d04b72a29745028f13","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AE is equal to EB, and ED is common, the two sides AE, ED are equal to the two sides BE, ED; and the base DA is equal to the base DB; therefore the angle AED is equal to the angle BED. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"双方AE、ED等同AE、ED等同BE、ED等同底边、DA等同底边、DB等同AED等同BED等同。（相关点与线段：EB） [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61f0bb1ada2f84125b5e594e7bc795422e543f6c159d4db44c90fc8576124b74","citations":["euclid-1-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the angles AED, BED is right; [[I. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)] therefore GK cuts AB into two equal parts and at right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AED、BED这两个角度都是对的;因此,GK把AB分成两个等分,直角分。 [[I. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58f64d3b5b577c25daf8e06e499b2ff9361dc53c80346a38f27b12ae10a1f37f","citations":["euclid-3-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, if in a circle a straight line cut a straight line into two equal parts and at right angles, the centre of the circle is on the cutting straight line, [[III. 1, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-1)] the centre of the circle is on GK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"而在圆圈里,如果一条直线将一条直线切成两个相等的部分,直角时,圆的中心线是直线,圆的中心线是GK。 [[III. 1, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9718f7929b53d1894cf1610d05b6b2874780d168538cd1e26017cb38515ec6fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the centre of the circle ABC is also on HL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,ABC圈的中心也位于HL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91541690a3614ec5b3df99c44fd275101c3a30b37a0776cc063016c5ef557ad8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the straight lines GK, HL have no other point common but the point D; therefore the point D is the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GK,HL直线除了D点以外没有其他共同点;因此,D点是ABC圆的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a9c9f4454495f7b7e4871b28c2fe73e2ff8ef49108c1ef10ea95ac5e663275c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜内从一点至界作三线以上皆等即此点必圜心解曰从甲点至乙丙丁圜界作甲乙甲丙甲丁三直线若等题言甲点为圜心三以上等者更不待论论曰试于乙丙丙丁界作乙丙丙丁两直线相聨此两线各两平分于戊于己从甲出两直线为甲戊为甲己其甲乙戊角形之甲乙与甲戊丙角形之甲丙两腰既等甲戊同腰乙戊戊丙两底又等即甲戊乙与甲戊丙两角亦等〈一卷八〉为两直角依显甲己丙甲己丁亦等为两直角则甲戊甲己之分乙丙丙丁俱平分为直角而此两线俱为函心线〈本篇一之系〉定相遇于甲甲为圜心矣又论曰若言甲非心心在于戊者令戊甲相聨引作己庚径线即甲是戊心外所取一点而从甲所出线愈近心者宜愈大矣〈本篇七〉则甲丁宜大于甲丙而先设等何也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个圆内，从一点向边界画三条或更多线，都相等；也就是说，这一点必须是圆心。解释如下：从点 甲 到 乙丙丁，画三条直线 甲乙甲丙甲丁。如果命题说明点 甲 位于圆心且在三条或更多线之上，则不需要讨论以下内容：尝试连接边界的两条线 乙丙丙丁、乙丙丙丁。这两条线在 戊 相交，在 己，从 甲 出现两条线。甲戊 是 甲己，且三角形 甲乙戊 和 甲戊丙 的两条边相等。甲戊 是同一条边，而 乙戊戊丙 有两条底边，因此 甲戊乙 和 甲戊丙 也相等。〈一卷八〉 是两个直角，且 显示为 甲己。甲乙戊 在三角形 甲戊 中有相等的边，乙戊戊丙 也有相等的底边，这意味着 甲戊乙 和 甲戊丙 的角也相等。〈一卷八〉 是两个直角， 显示为。 显示为 甲乙戊。三角形 甲乙 和 甲戊丙 的两条边相等。甲戊 是同一条边，乙戊戊丙 有两条底边，因此 甲戊乙 和 甲戊丙 也相等。〈一卷八〉 是两个直角， 显示为。 显示为。022 也是两个直角，那么 甲戊甲己 和 乙丙丙丁 的分割都是角平分线，两条线都经过圆心。〈本篇一之系〉 必须在 甲甲 相交作为圆心，并进一步证明如下：如果说 甲 不是圆心而圆心在 戊，那么让 戊甲 连接并作为 己庚 的直径，即 甲 是位于 戊 外的点，从 甲 出发的线应比最接近圆心的点更长。〈本篇七〉 那么为什么 甲丁 应该大于 甲丙 并且级次首先设置？"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-9.source","contentId":"euclid-3-9","revisionId":"euclid-3-9@raw-aac4531bfff1b76b","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ff663b603a07da306a5095b0784315dc2673bb58b3882ac088de3e64d122b4d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-9:euclid